PASS	arming, eligible target, requests and duplicate guard
PASS	conversation invalid and distant or party exclusions
PASS	transient inner PC failure allows retry
PASS	party min-one-HP guard restores each prior flag after settle, transition and unload
PASS	unreadable prior min-one-HP flag leaves that party member untouched
PASS	module load re-resolves a guarded party member whose object ID changed
PASS	module load re-resolves the guarded PC through GetFirstPC when its object ID changed
PASS	a member that cannot be re-resolved is recorded and retried; every resolvable guard is still cleared
PASS	frag VFX is unreachable when blast deaths arrive after the hook returns
PASS	frag VFX is reached only if a death script re-enters during the damage call
---
HOLDS 	A1 module load with new party IDs restores flag	new-id bastila min_one_hp=0 (prior was 0); SetMinOneHP calls=2
HOLDS 	A2 failed restore is retried at the next disarm (f:arm calls OnModuleLoad)	GetMinOneHP reads=2
HOLDS 	A3 unload during pending timer	flag after unload=0, extra SetMinOneHP from late timer=0
HOLDS 	A4 re-entrant detonation keeps original prior	reads=1 final=0 timers=2
HOLDS 	A5 nested generations: only last timer restores	gens=1,2 mid=1
HOLDS 	A6 boolean-false prior treated as unreadable	SetMinOneHP=0 (party member excluded when bridge returns false)
HOLDS 	A7 party gets floor(40/3)=13	amounts=40,13
HOLDS 	A8 OnAreaEnter by any object disarms+restores	armed after non-PC OnAreaEnter=0 (pre-existing behaviour, not new)
HOLDS 	P1 PC guarded then restored at settle	during=1 after=0
HOLDS 	P2 PC restored on unload; late timer inert	after=0
HOLDS 	P3 PC with new id after module load is restored	new-id PC min_one_hp=0
